> that slot for a robe or displacement.
> 
> What do you use? Artifacts? Shield of reflection?

The shield of reflection only if I have nothing else; it has too many
restrictions, like reducing spellcasting success to a minimum, preventing
two-weaponing, and being heavy. The silver dragon scales only if I have
the cloak of MR, and mainly only if playing a wizard; but even then, I
like displacement, and if a robe can put my spell success rate in a range
that is advantageous I'd prefer that choice. OTOH, I try to work for my
dragon mail; whatever of the two dragons (silver/gray) appears and leaves
scales may influence my decision. The artifact is a special case, and I
don't wish for artifacts so I don't care about it. What remains is the
amulet of reflection which is my primary choice in 95% of all my games.

But let me add; Nethack has no fixed ascension kit, depending what you
find and how the game evolves different decisions will have to be made,
and occasionally decisions have to be re-thought to have a most effective
game.

WRT amulets of life saving; I usually carry them around in my bag. If I
have an amulet of ESP I prefer even that (not in all but in most cases).

